A||||9||honegod||flaming fiero||||1||
Z||000000||honegod||12-19-2001||04:19 AM||||I was driving my 84 from little sisters house to my favorite computer store , about halfway there I notice that my acceleration was sluggish, what now.<BR>I got to the store and upon leaping out I smelled a harsh hot odor and saw faint smoke coming from the rear wheel.<BR>closer examination revealed the rotor glowing red, and flame flickering in the recesses of the caliper.<P>quick into the store to beg a glass of water to put it out.<P>about halfway into the cup filling ritual I hear a chorus of OOO, AAHHH s from the folks in front, and decide that half a glass is ok for now.<BR>by the time I got within eyesight of the brute a blowtorch of really neat bluegreen flame was shooting out of the wheel opening a foot or so.<P>I applied the water, and the flare died down.<P>a couple of cupfuls later the disc was steaming calmly.<P>I figure I will need to replace the caliper, and brake hose soon, since I am now driving it with only the front brakes really working much, LOTS of downshifting and not much brake pedal.<P>it's the SECOND time I have had to put this car out.<P>I like fieros, mine at least never ceases to amaze me.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||1
Z||000001||84Bill||12-19-2001||09:21 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by honegod:<BR><B><BR>I like fieros, mine at least never ceases to amaze me.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Yes, endearing little machines arent they.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>Glad to hear you got it out||||reg||1
Z||000002||Cyberkhat||12-19-2001||09:48 AM||||Thats got to be quite a rush...We love our little cars but the gremlins can be evil at times.GM parts bin technology at its best!||||reg||4
Z||000003||Pyric||12-19-2001||10:16 AM||||That is why I picked up a small chrome fire extinguisher from the local car parts store.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">  just incase.||||reg||12
