Z||000006||REDHOTT88||12-19-2001||12:04 PM||||Nothing like sitting in a burning car and having melted plastic dripping on your head!!!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>I think my next purchase will be a FIRE EXTINGUISHER!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_wtf.gif"><P>------------------<BR>                                                                                                         <BR>     <IMG SRC="http://www.stopstart.fsnet.co.uk/smilie/FIREdevil.gif">         <FONT COLOR="ffoooo"> <B>1988 Formula 2.8L</B> V6 5 speed  </FONT><BR><FONT SIZE="1">(Runs smooth, shifts crisp, red and shiny all over!)</FONT>||||reg||1
Z||000007||Cheever3000||12-19-2001||12:25 PM||||I don't know where your next trip will be after reading this topic, but <B>leave early and get an extinguisher!</B>  Do it today, the next time you drive somewhere.  Mine is on the floor right in front of the passenger seat.  I don't even see it until I open the passenger door.  They're not in the way, but even if they were, so are seatbelts.<BR><P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/CheeverXmasSig.jpg">   <BR><I>Merry Christmas from the </I><A HREF="http://www.cfog-i.org" TARGET=_blank><I>CFOG-I</I></A> <I>vice-president.</I>||||reg||1
Z||000008||fropuff||12-19-2001||08:38 PM||||Sorry to hear that.  I'm not certain, but I'd say that you need a new rotor as well.  When the rotor was hot and you poured cold water on it, it likely warped a bit.  Maybe turning it would work.  I don't know.  Hope everything turns out okay!||||reg||1
Z||000009||banditbalz||12-19-2001||08:43 PM||||honegod, your emergency break cable is sticking. I had the same thing happen, ohhh, 8 years ago. Had to replace all three cables to solve the problem. for a temp. solution, you can reach down under the rear cradle and pull (i mean pull hard) the line running from the adjuster to the caliper (one on each side). You're gonna get your hands dirty but it will loosen it up untill the next time you use the e-brake. <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/blackwhite2_3.jpg"> ||||reg||1
